          %h2#references References
          %h3#general_2 General
          %p The definition is originally due to
          %ul
            %li#Cayley1845
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Arthur+Cayley"}> Arthur Cayley
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em On certain results relating to quaternions
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1080/14786444508562684"} doi:10.1080/14786444508562684
          %p
            The formulation as the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dickson+double+construction"} Dickson double construction
            is due to
          %ul
            %li#Dickson1919
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Leonard+Dickson"}> Leonard Dickson
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em On Quaternions and Their Generalization and the History of the Eight Square Theorem
              %p
                Annals of Mathematics, Second Series, Vol. 20, No. 3 (Mar., 1919), pp. 155-171 (
                %a{:href => "https://www.jstor.org/stable/1967865"}> jstor:1967865
                )
          %p Review:
          %ul
            %li#Baez02
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/John+Baez"}> John Baez
                \:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em The Octonions
                %strong 39
                (2002) 145-205. &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "http://math.ucr.edu/home/baez/octonions/octonions.html"}> web
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "http://math.ucr.edu/home/baez/octonions/octonions.pdf"} pdf
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1090/S0273-0979-01-00934-X"} doi:10.1090/S0273-0979-01-00934-X
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Tevian+Dray"}> Tevian Dray
                \:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em The Geometry of Octonions
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://sites.science.oregonstate.edu/~tevian/talks/PSUpub.pdf"} pdf
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/Dray-GeometryOctonions.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
          %p Monographs:
          %ul
            %li#SpringerVeltkamp00
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Tonny+Springer"}> Tonny Springer
                ,
                = succeed ":" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ferdinand+Veldkamp"} Ferdinand Veldkamp
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Octonions, Jordan Algebras, and Exceptional Groups
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
