                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://sites.science.oregonstate.edu/coursewikis/GO/start.html"} web
          %p The concept of “special triples” or (“basic triples”) used above seems to go back to
          %ul
            %li#Whitehead71
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/George+Whitehead"}> George Whitehead
